# Hi-res source originals for the project thumbnails (11840x8000 PNGs, ~29 MB).
# Deliberately NOT versioned: they are authoring sources, Vite only ever copies public/,
# and nothing in src/ imports them — the shipped 1600px versions live in public/projects/.
# Kept on disk so the originals are still to hand for re-exports.
_source-hires/
